{"4806220":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Parcel Works: Packing Simulator","steam_appid":4806220,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Parcel Works: Packing Simulator<\/i>  where speed, accuracy, and organization matter. Take on the role of a warehouse worker as you sort orders, pack parcels, and prepare shipments in a timely manner if you want that time bonus pay.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Receive incoming orders, find the correct items, and pack them efficiently into boxes before labeling and shipping them out. As the warehouse gets busier, you’ll need to stay focused and manage your time wisely to keep up with demand. If you are running out of certain items, you will need to go to the computer to order more. Drink some coffee to gain energy to work faster for a limited time, but don't drink too much coffee or else your character might get dizzy and lose energy. Waiting out the Caffeine reset timer resets your energy and you can drink more coffee.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Parcel Works: Packing Simulator<\/i>  where speed, accuracy, and organization matter. Take on the role of a warehouse worker as you sort orders, pack parcels, and prepare shipments in a timely manner if you want that time bonus pay.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Receive incoming orders, find the correct items, and pack them efficiently into boxes before labeling and shipping them out. As the warehouse gets busier, you’ll need to stay focused and manage your time wisely to keep up with demand. If you are running out of certain items, you will need to go to the computer to order more. Drink some coffee to gain energy to work faster for a limited time, but don't drink too much coffee or else your character might get dizzy and lose energy. Waiting out the Caffeine reset timer resets your energy and you can drink more coffee.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p>","short_description":"A basic first-person warehouse simulator where you sort orders, pack parcels, and load the truck to get the orders out. Drinking coffee for an energy boost, but don't drink too much. You are merely an overworked employee who is working to one day buy the warehouse from your boss.","supported_languages":"English","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4806220\/9277e5e5137f56b7d746e0e5115c22f55634da98\/header.jpg?t=1793750241","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4806220\/c3f5eec312aebff72dac802ddaddcf4c93f04f70\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793750241","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4806220\/c3f5eec312aebff72dac802ddaddcf4c93f04f70\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793750241","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i5-8400 \/ AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> NVIDIA GTX 1060 \/ AMD RX 580<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 12<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 5 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 11 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i7-10700K \/ AMD Ryzen 5 5600X<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 16 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> NVIDIA RTX 3060 \/ AMD RX 6700 XT<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 12<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 15 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended